#: config.cpp:35
msgid "Decoration Settings"
msgstr "Postavke ukrasa"

#: config.cpp:37
msgid "Draw titlebar &stipple effect"
msgstr "Nacrtaj &stipple efekt za naslovne trake"

#: config.cpp:39
msgid ""
"When selected, active titlebars are drawn with a stipple (dotted) effect. "
"Otherwise, they are drawn without the stipple."
msgstr ""
"Ako je označeno, aktivne naslovne trake su nacrtane sa stipple (dotted) efektom. "
"Inače, nacrtane su bez njega."

#: config.cpp:43
msgid "Draw g&rab bar below windows"
msgstr "Nacrtaj g&rab traku ispod prozora"

#: config.cpp:45
msgid ""
"When selected, decorations are drawn with a \"grab bar\" below windows. "
"Otherwise, no grab bar is drawn."
msgstr ""
"Ako je označeno, dekoracije su nacrtane sa \"grab\" trakom ispod prozora. "
"Inače, \"grab\" trake nisu nacrtane."

#: config.cpp:51
msgid "Draw gr&adients"
msgstr "Nacrtaj gr&adijente"

#: config.cpp:53
msgid ""
"When selected, decorations are drawn with gradients for highcolor displays, "
"otherwise no gradients are drawn."
msgstr ""
"Ako je ovo izabrano, dekoracije su nacrtane sa gradijentima za ekrane sa više "
"boja, inače gradijenti nisu prisutni."

#: config.cpp:58
msgid "TitleBar Height"
msgstr "Visina naslovne trake"

#: config.cpp:61
msgid ""
"By adjusting this slider, you can modify the height of the titlebar to make "
"room for larger fonts."
msgstr ""
"Podešavanjem ovog klizača možete izmjeniti visinu naslovne trake kako "
"bi napravili prostora za veće fontove."

#: config.cpp:66
msgid "Normal"
msgstr "Normalno"

#: config.cpp:67
msgid "Large"
msgstr "Veliko"

#: config.cpp:69
msgid "Huge"
msgstr "Ogromno"

